{"id":"n15311-1-5","stage":2,"title":"못지않다 · 不亚于","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15311-1-5-1","ko":"너 어제 보니까 정말 가수 못지않게 노래를 잘 하더라.","zh":"我昨天看到你的演唱，唱得简直不输给专业歌手呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"보니까","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니까","audio":"/audio/da5702f163f863395e8e.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"가수","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}},{"text":"못지않게","meaning":"不亚于，不次于","explanation":"못지않다：不亚于，不次于；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"못지않다","audio":"/audio/dfe312f9c5e61d775a4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15311","senseId":"1","lemma":"못지않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못지않게","audio":"/audio/032e73004f683fe88d80.mp3"}},{"text":"노래를","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래를","audio":"/audio/e4d8b71da5f5c71ee421.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"하더라.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하더라","audio":"/audio/db4aecb98efe8e073128.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"9e173c93773cc558","term":"가수","zh":"歌手","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3","entryId":"62256","definition":"以唱歌为职业的人。","pronunciation":["가수"]},{"id":"dfe312f9c5e61d77","term":"못지않다","zh":"不亚于，不次于","audio":"/audio/dfe312f9c5e61d775a4f.mp3","entryId":"15311","definition":"在与其他事物比较时，不落后或不差劲儿。","pronunciation":["몯ː찌안타"